Capacity [SimTalk] - Exporter
Sets the Capacity of the Exporter designated by <Path>.
Remarks
The Capacity is a value greater than or equal to zero.
Note
You can only reduce the capacity if the Capacity provided to the importers is not fallen short of. If you
increase the capacity, the Broker will immediately attempt to find new importers.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.Capacity:integer
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type integer.
Example
MyExporter.Capacity := 2
See also
